sequenceDiagram
    participant A as A (central manager)
    participant Bp as B (peripheral manager)
    participant Bc as B (central manager)
    participant C as C (peripheral manager)

    A->>A: distance(B) within threshold, send(to B), activeSessionId = B
    A->>Bp: encrypted payload
    Bc->>Bc: distance(C) within threshold at the same moment, send(to C)
    Note over Bp: ExchangeSession calls peripheral.declineAll()
    Bp->>Bp: payload from A ignored, A not selected
    Bp-->>A: notify declined
    A->>A: handleDecline(B), B is selected
    A->>A: activeSessionId = nil, transferQueue.clear()
    A->>A: onDeclined, ExchangeSession.restart()
    Note over A: New nonce, scan and advertise again. B is not found since it stopped advertising
